<x-screen-instructions title="How to use Subscriptions">
    <p>Every member subscription record — most get created at check-in or from a member's own panel, but you can browse, correct, or bulk-purchase from here directly.</p>
    <p>Use the header's bulk-purchase action to buy a multi-month bundle for a member without going through the check-in desk. The <strong>Plan</strong> select offers Entry (the standard subscription) plus whatever other add-ons this club has flagged Subscribable.</p>
    <p>The monthly Manager &amp; Owner free-subscription perk also grants from this list's header — it's available to exactly Manager and Owner, not Admin, by design.</p>
</x-screen-instructions>
